ey information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making and Refusing a Request"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use these phrases to make a request (for help or other reasons)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use these phrases to decline simple requests."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Making a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Refusing a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you help me ... ?<br/>Can you give me a hand ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Unfortunately, I can't.<br />  I really wish I could, but I can't.  <br />Sorry, I can't ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Jim</span>:     Can you give me a hand with these forms? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Natalie</span>:  Unfortunately, I can't."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Time and Dates"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use the question <span class=\"italic\">What time is it?</span> to ask for the time. <br /> You can use <span class=\"italic\">When is the ... ?</span> to ask for the day and date of an event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use<span class=\"italic\"> on, in, at</span> to talk about the time and the date."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use<span class=\"italic\"> on</span> to talk about the day and date -- On Wednesday, On March 21st.<br />You use<span class=\"italic\"> in</span> to talk about the period -- In a month, In a week, In the afternoon.<br />You use<span class=\"italic\"> at</span> to talk about a specific time -- At 4:30."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the chart below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use a.m. to say what time it is in the morning between midnight and noon.<br />You use p.m. to say what time it is between noon and midnight."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: What time is it?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Jill</span>: It's 12 p.m.<br /><span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: Time for lunch!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ask<span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Say</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What time is it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's 5 p.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When is the meeting?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is on Wednesday, March 15th at 11 a.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" When is your birthday?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" It is in a month, on July 31st.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scholarship "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an amount of money given to a student by a college or organization "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to fill out the college scholarship forms."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in conversations with friends."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "college"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a school where students get specialized skills or training usually after high school "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I study at Kingston College."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I can't!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I am not able to do it!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm sorry, I can't. I am busy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "date of birth   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the day a person is born  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What is your date of birth?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "first name  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person's name  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My first name is John. My full name is John Simmons."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le02ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (6 to 8 lines) with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make and refuse requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain why you are refusing a request."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Join sentences using <span class=\"italic\">and</span>, <span class=\"italic\">or</span>, <span class=\"italic\">but</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make and decline requests in a dialogue."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I join sentences using <span class=\"italic\">and</span>, <span class=\"italic\">but</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">or</span> in a dialogue."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice my dialogue with a partner."}]}]}